{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28281","headline":"长安杂题长句六首 一 · 杜牧","name":"长安杂题长句六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"觚棱金碧照山高，万国珪璋捧赭袍。\n舐笔和铅欺贾马，赞功论道鄙萧曹。\n东南楼日珠帘卷，西北天宛玉厄豪。\n四海一家无一事，将军携镜泣霜毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}